<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LAM" style="id">- Dawuro Full Bible Latin Version</book>
  <para style="h">Ermaasa Seelaa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ermaasa Seelaa Odiyaa Mas'aafaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ermaasa Seelaa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Sel.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ermaasa Seelaa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Odiyaa Mas'aafaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Geluwaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Ermaasa seelaa odiyaa mas'aafay, Kiristtoosi yelettanaappe kase ichcheshu s'eetanne hosppun tammanne usuppun laytsan Yerusaalame laaletteedda gaasuwaaninne asaykka omoodettiide beedda gaasuwaan, S'oossay S'oossatetsaa Muruwaa polanaw Baabloonatuwaa bare shoc'iyaa s'am"aa ootsiide go"eteedda gaasuwaan, gins's'uwaan giigeedda ichcheshu kayyuwaa zilaassatuwaa oyk'k'eeddawaa. Ha mas'aafaw dariyaa baggay yeekuwaabaanne kayyuwaabaa odiyaawaa gidooppenne, S'oossan ammanettiyaawaanne hidootan de'iyaawaa odiyaa kifiletuukka an de'iino. Ha gins's'otuwaa Ayihuda asatuu Kiristtoosi yelettanaappe kase ichcheshu s'eetanne hosppun tammanne usuppun laytsan, he biittaa bolla gakkeedda bayetsaa hassayanaw, laytsan laytsan s'oomiyaanne kayyotiyaa wogatuwaa poliyaa gallassatuwaan go'ettiino.</para>
  <para style="iot">Shemppatuwaa Ubbatoo Imetteedda K'antsa K'ofatuwaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Yerusaalame Metuwaanne Kayyuwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="LAM 1:1-22">1:1-22</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">S'oossay Yerusaalame Bolla Aheedda Muruwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="LAM 2:1-22">2:1-22</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Biro Hidootay De'iyaawaa Gidussaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="LAM 3:1-66">3:1-66</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yerusaalame Bashshaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="LAM 4:1-22">4:1-22</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Maarotaa Demanaw Woosaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="LAM 5:1-22">5:1-22</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LAM 1"/>
  <para style="s">Yerusaalame Metuwaanne Kayyuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LAM 1:1-22">1:1-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 1:1"/>Kase Asay kumeedda Yerusaalame katamata ha"i waanaade mela attadee! Kase kawutetsatuwaa giddon wolk'k'aama gideeddaana ha"i asinay hayk'k'eedda mishirattiidan, waanaade barekka attadee! Katamatuwaa ubbaa giddon kaatato gideeddaana ha"i waanaade ayile gidaadee! <verse eid="LAM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 1:2"/>K'amma ubbaan afotsay I gac'uwaana holssakkattishin, yeekkaade ak'aadu. Kase izo dosiyaawanttuppe ha"i izo mintsetsiyaawe ittuunne baawa. I laggetuu izo aatsi immiide, iw morkke gideeddino. <verse eid="LAM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 1:3"/>Yihudata naak'ettaadenne ayiletaade omoodettaade baaddu. Iza ha"i kawutetsatuwaa giddon de'aw; shin shemppiyaa sa'aa demmabeykku. Izo yedersseeddawanttu iza metoota de'ishshin gakkiide demmeeddino. <verse eid="LAM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 1:4"/>Laytsaa giddon bonchchiyaa baalatuwaa yiyaawe bayinna diraw, S'iyoone ogetuu kayyottiino. Katamaa penggetuu mela atteeddino; I k'eesatuu kka ooliino. I wodoro naanatuukka tuggateeddino; k'ay iza bare huup'iyawukka iita tuggaa tuggataaddu. <verse eid="LAM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 1:5"/>I morkketuu iw goda gideeddino; unttunttoo injjina de'eeddino. Ayaw gooppe, I nagaraa daruwaa gaasuwaan Med'inaa Goday izo tuggayeedda; I guutsa naanatuu morkkiyaan omoodettiide beeddino. <verse eid="LAM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 1:6"/>S'iyoon bonchchuu ubbay iippe k'aaretti kichcheedda; I kaappatuukka maataa miyaa sa'aa d'ayeedda gaaraa mala gideeddino. Unttunttu wolk'k'aa d'ayiide, barentta yederssiyaawanttu sintsaappe bak'ateeddino.<verse eid="LAM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 1:7"/>Yerusaalama ha"i bare tuggaanne bare un"aa gallassatuwaan beni bare bonchcho duretaa hassayaw. I Asay ubbay morkkatuwaa kushiyan aad'd'iide imetteedda wode, izo maaddiyaawe ittuunne attibeena. I morkketuu izo s'eelliide, I bashshaan miic'c'eeddino. <verse eid="LAM 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 1:8"/>Yerusaalama wolk'k'aama nagaraa ootsaaddu; hewaa diraw, iza tunabaa gidaw. Kase izo bonchcheedda ubbay ha"i I kalluwaa be'eedda diraw, izo kad'ee. Akka oolawunne guyye simmaw. <verse eid="LAM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 1:9"/>I tunatetsay I afilaa s'eeraa bak'k'i oyk'k'eedda. Sintsappe bare bolla yaanabaa iza k'oppabeykku. Hewaa diraw, izi kunddetsay dagantsiyaawaa. Iza, «Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, ta tuggaa be'a! Ta morkketuu taana s'ooneeddino» giinakka, izo mintsetsiyaawe ittuunne baawa. <verse eid="LAM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 1:10"/>Morkketuu izi bonchcho duretaa ubbaa bollan barenttu kushiyaa yeddeeddino. Gadiyaa kawutetsatuu, kase neeni S'oossaa maabaraa giddo gelissennan diggeedda asatuu, I Geeshsha Golliyaa gelishin be'aaddu. <verse eid="LAM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 1:11"/>Izi asatuu koshatiide, k'umaa demmanaw ooliino. Unttunttu pas'a de'ana diraw giide, barenttu bonchcho duretaa ubbaa k'uman laammiino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LAM 1:11">Yerusaalama hawaadan yaagaw; «Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, s'eella; taani kad'etteeddawaa be'a! <verse eid="LAM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 1:12"/>Hinttenoo, hawaana aad'd'iyaawanttoo, hawe hinttew ubbaw ayaanne gidennee? Metuu ubbay Med'inaa Goday bare ees's'iyaa hank'k'uwaa gallassi ta bolla aheedda metuwaa malee? <verse eid="LAM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 1:13"/>S'oossay bolla d'ok'k'aappe tamaa duge yeddeedda; he tamay ta mek'etsaa giddo geleedda. Ta gediyaa oyk'k'anaw p'iriyaa wotseedda; taana guyye zaareedda. I taana gallassaa ubbaan labbantsiide, yeggi basheedda. <verse eid="LAM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 1:14"/>Taani ootseedda nagaraa ubbaa shiishshi k'achchiide, morgge mitsaadan ta morggiyaan wotseedda. Yaatiide ta wolk'k'aa wursseedda. Taani ek'ettanaw danddayennawanttoo Goday taana aatsi immeedda. <verse eid="LAM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 1:15"/>Goday ta giddon wolk'k'aama olanchchatuwaa ubbaa is's'eedda. Ta yalagatuwaakka d'ayissanaw wodiyaa keereedda. Woynniyaa teeraa gum"iyaa sa'aan yed'd'iyaawaadan, Goday Yihudaa asaa yed'd'eedda. <verse eid="LAM 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 1:16"/>Taani yeekkiyaawenne ta ayifii afotsaa holssayiyaawe hewaassa. Taana mintsetsanawunne ta wolk'k'aa minisiyaawe itti asaynne baawa. Morkkii goobeedda; ta naanatuunne mela atteeddino» yaagaw.<verse eid="LAM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 1:17"/>S'iyoona bare kushiyaa mic'c'aaddu; shin izo mintsetsiyaawe baawa. I yuushshuwaan de'iyaawanttu izo morkkanaadan, Med'inaa Goday ootseedda. Yerusaalama unttunttu giddon tunabaa gidaaddu.<verse eid="LAM 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 1:18"/>Iza hawaadan yaagaw; «Med'inaa Goday s'illuwaa; Aa k'aalaw azazettenan makkaleeddaanna taana. Hinttenoo, asatoo ubbaykka sisite! Ta metuwaakka be'ite. Ta wodallatuunne ta geelayotuu omoodettiide beeddino. <verse eid="LAM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 1:19"/>Taani taana dosiyaawantta s'eesaad; shin unttunttu taana c'immeeddino. Ta k'eesatuu nne ta c'imatuu barenttu akataa minisanaw k'umaa koyiidde, katamaa giddon hayk'k'eeddino. <verse eid="LAM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 1:20"/>Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, ta waayiyaa be'a! Ta garssay shabbiretteedda. Taani loytsa makkaleedda diraw, ta wozanay me"eedda. Karen mashshay wurssee; soonikka hayk'k'o s'alalay de'ee. <verse eid="LAM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 1:21"/>Asay taani zilaaliyaawaa siseedda; shin taana mintsetsiyaa itti asaynne baawa. Ta morkketuu ubbay taani metootiyaawaa siseeddino; neeni ootseeddabaan nashetteeddino. Unttunttukka taanaadan hanana mala, unttunttu bolla neeni awaayeedda gallassaa ayaa! <verse eid="LAM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 1:22"/>Unttunttu iitatetsay ubbay ne sintsa gakko; ta nagaraa ubbaa diraw, neeni taana mureeddawaadan, unttunttakka mura! Ayaw gooppe, ta zilaassay dareedda; ta wozanaykka me"eedda» yaagaw.<verse eid="LAM 1:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LAM 2"/>
  <para style="s">S'oossay Yerusaalame Bolla Aheedda Muruwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LAM 2:1-22">2:1-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 2:1"/>Goday bare hank'k'uwaan shaariyaappe garssana S'iyoono wooti wotseeddee! I Israa'eeliyaa puulaa saluwaappe duge sa'aa oleedda. I bare hank'k'uwaa gallassan bare Geeshsha Golliyaakka k'oppibeenna. <verse eid="LAM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 2:2"/>Goday Yihudaan de'iyaa keetsatuwaa ubbaa k'arettennaan d'ayisseedda. K'ay bare hank'k'uwaan he biittaa geessuwaa ubbaa koleedda. He kawutetsaanne Aa kaappotuwaa sa'aan duge wotsiide kawushshiseedda. <verse eid="LAM 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 2:3"/>Bare suulliyaa hank'k'uwaan Israa'eeliyaa wolk'k'aa ubbaa mentsereetseedda. Morkkii Aa olanaw yiyaa wode, Goday bare ushechcha kushiyaa unttunttu bollappe diggeedda. Bare yuushshuwaan de'iyaawaa ubbaa miyaa lac'ottiyaa tamaadan, Yaak'ooba bolla ees's'i keseedda. <verse eid="LAM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 2:4"/>Morkkiyaadan I bare wonddaafiyaa unttunttu bolla dafeedda. Uk'k'unniyaawanttuwaadan I bare ushechcha kushiyaa minisiide, s'eellina lo"iyaa asaa ubbaa wod'eedda. S'iyoone golletuwaa bolla bare hank'k'uwaa suuluwaa tamaadan gusseedda. <verse eid="LAM 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 2:5"/>Goday morkkiyaadan haniide, Israa'eeliyaa d'ayisseedda. I kaatiyaa golletuwaanne geessotuwaa ubbaa koleedda. Yihudaa asaa bollan kayyuwaanne yeekuwaa gujjeedda.<verse eid="LAM 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 2:6"/>I bare Geeshsha Golliyaa ataakilttiyaa giddon de'iyaa daasiyaadan, shod oleedda. Laytsaa giddon bonchchiyaa baalatuunne Sambbatatuu mule dogettanaadan, Med'inaa Goday ootseedda. Bare wolk'k'aama hank'k'uwaan kaatiyaanne k'eesiyaa kad'eedda. <verse eid="LAM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 2:7"/>Goday barew yarshshuwaa yarshshiyaa sa'aa is's'eedda; bare Geeshsha Golliyaakka basheedda. Kaatiyaa golletuwaa gimbbiyaa morkkatuwaa kushiyan aatsiide immeedda. Asay laytsaa baalaa bonchchiidde waassiyaawaadan, morkketuu Med'inaa Godaa Golliyaan waasseeddino. <verse eid="LAM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 2:8"/>Med'inaa Goday S'iyoon gimbbiyaa kolanaw k'achcheeda; izo likkiyaa wodoruwaa mic'c'eedda; izo d'ayissennan de'iiddi, bare kushiyaa zaarenna. Hewaa diraw, gimbbiinne geessuu ittippe kunddanaadan ootseedda. <verse eid="LAM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 2:9"/>Yerusaalame penggiyaa sank'k'atuu biittan duge moogetteeddino; unttunttu kulbbotuwaakka I mentsereetsiide d'ayisseedda. I kaatiinne kaappatuu omoodettiide, kawutetsatuwaa giddo beeddino. Higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawekka baawa; Izi timbbitiyaa odiyaawanttookka Med'inaa Godaappe sas'ay yiyaawaa aggeeda. <verse eid="LAM 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 2:10"/>S'iyoon c'imatuu c'o"u giide, biittan utti aggeeddino; barenttu huup'iyaan baanaa k'oliide, maak'aakka mayyeeddino. Yerusaalame wodorotuu sa'aw duge hokkeeddino.<verse eid="LAM 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 2:11"/>Ta ayifii afos's'i afos's'iidde jolleedda; ta wozanaykka kayyuwaan shabbiretteedda. Ayaw gooppe, ta Asay d'ayeedda; guutsa naanatuunne yii'o naanatuu katamaa ogiyaan labbaniide kunddeeddino. <verse eid="LAM 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 2:12"/>Unttunttu barenttu aayetuwaa, «K'umaa imma! Woynniyaa eessaa imma!» yaagiide waassiino. Katamaa ogiyaan deshettiide labbaniyaa asatuwaadan unttunttu labbanina, unttunttu aayetuwaa kiwuwaan unttunttu shemppuu kesee.<verse eid="LAM 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 2:13"/>Neenoo, Yerusaalame, taani nebaa ay gaanaw danddayayitaa? Woy k'ay ne k'ohuwaa taani ayaana likkanaw danddayayitaa? Neenoo, dosetteedda S'iyoonee, k'ay taani neena woota mintsetsanaw danddayayitaa? Ne madutsay abbaa keeshshaa c'iimma. Yaatina, neena ooni patsanaw danddayii? <verse eid="LAM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 2:14"/>Ne timbbitiyaa odiyaawanttu new worddonne patsenna sas'aa be'eeddino; unttunttu neeni omoodoo beenna mala, ne nagaraa k'onc'c'issiide odibeykkino. Unttunttu baletsiyaa worddo sas'aa new be'eeddino.<verse eid="LAM 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 2:15"/>Ne mataana aad'd'iyaa ubbay bare birad'd'iyaa ne bollan dukkee. K'ay, «Biittan sa'aan ubbaappe aad'd'aade lo"iyaa katamata hannii? Kumentsaa biittaw nashshechchaa geetetteedda katamata hannii?» yaagiide neena k'iliic'eeddino; barenttu huup'iyaakka k'aatsiino. <verse eid="LAM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 2:16"/>Ne morkketuu ubbay barenttu doonaa ne bolla dooyeeddino; k'iliic'iiddinne yiluwaan barenttu achchaa garc'c'iidde, «Nuuni izo d'ayisseeddo! Nuuni naageedda gallassaykka hawaa; ha"i gakkiide be'eedda!» yaagiino. <verse eid="LAM 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 2:17"/>Med'inaa Goday bare halchcheeddawaa ootseedda; beni wode I awaayeedda bare k'aalaakka poleedda. Yerusaalamiw k'arettennaan izo koleedda. I morkkatuwaakka nashechcheedda; izo uk'k'unneeddawanttu wolk'k'aakka d'ok'k'u d'ok'k'u ootseedda.<verse eid="LAM 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 2:18"/>Neenoo, S'iyoonee, Godaakko ne dirssaa gimbbii waasso! Ne afotsayikka k'ammanne gallassi shaafaadan goggo! Neeni neena shemppissoppa; ne ayifiyawukka shemppuwaa immoppa! <verse eid="LAM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 2:19"/>Dendda; k'amma denddaade waassa. Godaa sintsan ne wozanaa haatsaadan gussa. Ogiyaa doonaan ubbaan koshatiide, labbaneedda ne naanatuwaa shemppoo ne kushiyaa aakko pude dentsaade woossa!<verse eid="LAM 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 2:20"/>Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, be'a! Neeni O bolla kase hawaadan ootsaaddintto, ane k'oppa. Aayetuu barenttu kiwuwaan ishalissiide dichcheedda barenttu naanatuwaa miino gay? K'ay k'eesatuu nne nabetuu Godaa Geeshsha Golliyaa giddon hayk'k'ino gay?<verse eid="LAM 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 2:21"/>C'imaynne naanay katamaa giddo ogiyaa baanan giseedda; ta wodorotuunne ta wodallatuu mashshaan wureeddino. Neeni ne hank'k'uwaa gallassi unttuntta wod'aadda; unttunttoo k'arettennaan unttuntta siifaadda.<verse eid="LAM 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 2:22"/>Gibiraa gallassaw asaa s'eesiyaawaadan, neeni taana dagantsiyaawantta ubba saappe s'eesaadda. Med'inaa Godaa hank'k'uwaa gallassan kessi akki pas'a atteedawe ittuunne baawa. Taani ta kiwuwaan ishalissaade dichcheedda naanatuwaa ubbaa morkkii wod'i d'ayisseedda.<verse eid="LAM 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LAM 3"/>
  <para style="s">Biro Hidootay De'iyaawaa Gidussaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LAM 3:1-66">3:1-66</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 3:1"/>S'oossaa hank'k'uwaa gatiman metuwaa be'eedda Asay taana. <verse eid="LAM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 3:2"/>I taana laaggi kessiide, poo'uu bayinna d'umaw afeeda. <verse eid="LAM 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 3:3"/>I zaari zaariidekka gallassaa muliyaa taana shoc'anaw bare kushiyaa ta bollan dentseedda. <verse eid="LAM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 3:4"/>I ta galbbaanne ta ashuwaa ec'iseedda; ta mek'etsaakka mentseedda. <verse eid="LAM 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 3:5"/>I taana direedda; metuwaaninne daaburan I taana dooddeedda. <verse eid="LAM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 3:6"/>Beni ayidentto hayk'k'eedda asaadan, taana d'umaa giddon wotseedda. <verse eid="LAM 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 3:7"/>Taani kesennaadan, ta yuushshuwaa direedda; dees'o sanssalatankka taana k'achcheeda. <verse eid="LAM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 3:8"/>Taani Aa s'eesaad; aakko waassinakka, I ta woosaa sisennan is's'eedda. <verse eid="LAM 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 3:9"/>Ta ogiyaan masetteedda shuchchaa wotsiide gorddeedda; ta ogiyaakka geellayeedda.<verse eid="LAM 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 3:10"/>I taw muggiyaa Babantsaa mala, woy k'osettiide naagiyaa gaammuwaa mala gideedda. <verse eid="LAM 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 3:11"/>I taana ta ogiyaappe kessi oliide, duuseretseedda. Yaatiide taana Asay bayinna saan yeggi basheedda.<verse eid="LAM 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 3:12"/>Bare wonddaafiyaa dafiide, taana dukkanaw maleedda. <verse eid="LAM 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 3:13"/>I bare wonddaafiyaa dafiide, ta wozanaa ayifiyaa c'addeedda. <verse eid="LAM 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 3:14"/>Taani asaa ubbaw miichchaanne gallassaa kumentsaa boriidde yes's'iyaawaa gidaaddi. <verse eid="LAM 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 3:15"/>I taana c'amuwaan kuntseedda; k'ay godare uutsaadan c'ammiyaa s'uu'aa ushshiide, taana kalisseedda.<verse eid="LAM 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 3:16"/>I ta achchaa anc'c'uwaan mentseedda; baana giddon I taana yed'd'eedda. <verse eid="LAM 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 3:17"/>Saruu taappe haakkeedda; taani injje de'uwaa dogaad. <verse eid="LAM 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 3:18"/>Hewaa diraw, taani, «Ta wolk'k'ay taappe kichcheedda; taani Med'inaa Godaan hidootaa wotseeddawe ubbaykka d'ayeedda» yaagaad. <verse eid="LAM 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 3:19"/>Ta metuwaanne taani toyilakattiyaawaa hassayina, de'uu taana c'ammeedda. <verse eid="LAM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 3:20"/>Hewe taani ubbakka dogennabaanne ta shemppuukka kayyottiyaawaa.<verse eid="LAM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 3:21"/>Gidooppenne, taani ha ittibaa ta wozanaan k'oppiyaa wode, taw sintsanaw hidootay de'ee. <verse eid="LAM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 3:22"/>Hewenne, Med'inaa Godaa aggena siik'uwaappe denddeeddawaan nuuni d'ayibookko. Aa k'aretaykka mule wuri erenna; <verse eid="LAM 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LAM 3:23"/>unttunttu wontta wontta ooratsa. Neeni loytsa ammanettiyaawaa. <verse eid="LAM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LAM 3:24"/>Taani taw, «Med'inaa Goday taana gakkeedda saamaa; hewaa diraw, taani aan hidootaa wotsay» yaagaad.<verse eid="LAM 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LAM 3:25"/>Barenttu hidootaa an wotsiyaawanttoonne Aa koyiyaawanttoo Med'inaa Goday lo"o. <verse eid="LAM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LAM 3:26"/>Hewaa diraw, Asay Med'inaa Goday ashshiyaa ashshuwaa danddayan naagooppe lo"a. <verse eid="LAM 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LAM 3:27"/>K'ay Asay bare yalagatetsan de'iiddi, danddayaa tamaarooppe lo"a.<verse eid="LAM 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LAM 3:28"/>Med'inaa Goday metuwaa ahiyaa wode, I c'o"u giide, barekka utti aggo. <verse eid="LAM 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LAM 3:29"/>I bare som"uwaa biittaa gatsiide hayzzo. Ooni erii, aw sintsanaw hidootay de'anenttonne. <verse eid="LAM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LAM 3:30"/>I bare shayiyaa bak'k'iyaawoo besso; bare morkketuu shek'k'iyaa shek'aakka kallo.<verse eid="LAM 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LAM 3:31"/>Ayaw gooppe, Goday asaa med'inaw olenna; <verse eid="LAM 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LAM 3:32"/>itti wode kayyuwaa ahooppenne, I bare aggena siik'uwaa daruwaadan k'arettee. <verse eid="LAM 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LAM 3:33"/>Ayaw gooppe, I asaa tuggayiyaawaaninne metoyiyaawan nashettena.<verse eid="LAM 3:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LAM 3:34"/>Aa asaa kaaletsiyaawanttu k'ashetteeddawantta barenttu gediyaappe garssa baggana yed'd'eeddino; <verse eid="LAM 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LAM 3:35"/>k'ay Ubbaappe D'ok'k'iyaa S'oossaa sintsan asaw de'iyaa maataa diggiino; <verse eid="LAM 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LAM 3:36"/>k'aykka chilootan pirddaa geellayiino. Unttunttu Goday hewaa ubbaa be'enna giide k'oppiinoyye?<verse eid="LAM 3:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LAM 3:37"/>Goday azazibeenawaa azaziide, polissanaw danddayiyaawe oonee? <verse eid="LAM 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LAM 3:38"/>Iitabaa gidina lo"obaa gidinakka, haasayiide poliyaawe Ubbaappe D'ok'k'iyaa S'oossaa gidenneeyye? <verse eid="LAM 3:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LAM 3:39"/>Yaatina, nuuni asaa gidiyaawanttu nu nagaraa diraw, I nuuna muriyaa wode, ayaw zuuzummeettoo?<verse eid="LAM 3:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LAM 3:40"/>Hewaa aggiide, ane nu ogiyaa paac'c'oyttenne k'oroytte; Med'inaa Godaakkokka ane simmoytte. <verse eid="LAM 3:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LAM 3:41"/>Ane nu wozanaanne nu kushiyaa saluwaan de'iyaa S'oossaakko dentsiide, hawaadan yaagoytte; <verse eid="LAM 3:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LAM 3:42"/>«Nuuni neena naak'k'eeddo; new makkaleeddo; neenikka nuw atto gabaakka. <verse eid="LAM 3:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LAM 3:43"/>Ne hank'k'uwaan nuuna yederssaadda; k'ay neeni nuw k'arettennaan nuuna siifaadda. <verse eid="LAM 3:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LAM 3:44"/>Nu woosay neekko aad'd'enaadan, ne huup'iyaa shaariyaan kammaadda. <verse eid="LAM 3:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LAM 3:45"/>Asaa giddon nuuna pittonne buuraa ootsaadda. <verse eid="LAM 3:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LAM 3:46"/>Nu morkketuu ubbay nu bollan haasayeeddino. <verse eid="LAM 3:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LAM 3:47"/>Nuuni dagammeeddonne gitiyaan geleeddo; bayeeddonne d'ayeeddo» yaageetto.<verse eid="LAM 3:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LAM 3:48"/>Ta Asay metuwaan d'ayeedda diraw, ta ayifii shaafaadan afotsaa goggee. <verse eid="LAM 3:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LAM 3:49"/>Ta ayifii mule wode aggenaan afotsaa tigee. <verse eid="LAM 3:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LAM 3:50"/>Med'inaa Goday saluwaappe duge s'eelliide be'ana gakkanaw hewe hanee. <verse eid="LAM 3:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LAM 3:51"/>Ta kataman de'iyaa mac'c'a asatuwaa ubbaa bollan gakkeeddawaa ta ayifii be'eedda wode, ta wozanay kayyotteedda.<verse eid="LAM 3:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LAM 3:52"/>C'oo taana morkkiyaawanttu taana kafuwaa shankkatiyaawaadan shankkateeddino. <verse eid="LAM 3:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LAM 3:53"/>Unttunttu taana pas'a de'ishiina ollaan yeggiide, ollaa doonaa shuchchaan gorddeeddino. <verse eid="LAM 3:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LAM 3:54"/>Haatsay kumiide, ta huup'iyaana goggiyaa wode, taani d'ayaad gaade k'oppaad.<verse eid="LAM 3:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LAM 3:55"/>Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, taani c'iimma ollaa giddon de'aadde ne suntsaa s'eesaad. <verse eid="LAM 3:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LAM 3:56"/>Ta waasuwaa sisanaadaan taani neena woossiyaa wode, neeni taw sisaadda. <verse eid="LAM 3:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LAM 3:57"/>Taani neena s'eeseedda wode, taakko shiik'aade, «Yayyoppa» yaagaadda. <verse eid="LAM 3:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LAM 3:58"/>Abeet Godaw, neeni ta mootuwaa mootettaade, taana wozaadda. <verse eid="LAM 3:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LAM 3:59"/>Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, neeni ta tuggaa be'aadda. Hewaa diraw, ta mootuwaa neeni pirdda. <verse eid="LAM 3:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LAM 3:60"/>Unttunttu haluwaa kessanaw ta bollan mak'ettiyaa mak'k'uwaa ubbaa be'aadda. <verse eid="LAM 3:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LAM 3:61"/>Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, unttunttu taana shek'k'iyaa shek'aanne ta bollan mak'ettiyaa mak'k'uwaa ubbaa sisaadda. <verse eid="LAM 3:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LAM 3:62"/>K'ay ta morkketuu gallassaa kumentsaa ta bollan zuuzummiyaawaanne saasukkiyaawaa sisaadda. <verse eid="LAM 3:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LAM 3:63"/>Be'a, unttunttu uttiiddinne ek'k'iide, taana bori boriidde yes's'iino.<verse eid="LAM 3:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="LAM 3:64"/>Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, unttunttu ootseedda oosoo bessiyaa gatiyaa unttunttoo c'igga! <verse eid="LAM 3:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LAM 3:65"/>Unttunttu wozanaa dammissa! Ne shek'ay unttuntta gakko! <verse eid="LAM 3:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LAM 3:66"/>Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, neeni unttuntta ne hank'k'uwaan yederssa, salotuwaappe garssaana unttunttu de'iyaasaappe unttuntta d'ayissa!<verse eid="LAM 3:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LAM 4"/>
  <para style="s">Yerusaalame Bashshaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LAM 4:1-22">4:1-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 4:1"/>P'ooliyaa work'k'ay bare malaa waaniide taseeddee. Geeshsha work'k'ay waaniide malaa d'ayeedde. Geeshsha Gollii kees'etteedda shuchchay katamatuwaa ogiyaa ubbaa doonaan laaletti utteedda. <verse eid="LAM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 4:2"/>Kase bonchchetteedda work'k'aa lagge gideedda S'iyoone naanatuu ha"i kushiyaa hiillay urk'k'aappe med'd'eedda miishshaa mala gideeddino.<verse eid="LAM 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 4:3"/>Haray atto worakanatuwaanne bare maraa d'antsaw; shin ta Asay bazzuwaan de'iyaa sogoniyaadan, bare naanaatoo mek'etsaa iiteedda. <verse eid="LAM 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 4:4"/>Saamuwaa gaasuwaan d'ammiyaa naanatuwaa ins's'arssay kookkiyaana oyk'k'etteedda; naanatuu k'umaa woosseeddino; shin unttunttoo immiyaawe ittuunne baawa. <verse eid="LAM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 4:5"/>Kase mal"iyaa k'uma s'alala meeddawanttu ha"i ogiyaa doonaan koshaan wuriino; k'ay kase ishaluwaan dic'c'eeddawanttu ha"i bidintsaa bolla zak'k'ulleeddino.<verse eid="LAM 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 4:6"/>Ta asaa nagaray O kushiinne bochchennaaninne k'oppennaan aad'd'i wod'd'eedda Sodooma katamaa asaa nagaraappekka dareedda<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Dom. 19:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LAM 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 4:7"/>Yihudaa kaappatuu kase shachchaappe aad'd'eeda geeshshanne maatsaappe aad'd'eeda bootsa. Unttunttu bollay zo'o ink'k'uwaappe aad'd'eeda arssa; unttunttu malaykka samppeeriyaa giyaa al"o ink'k'uwaa mala. <verse eid="LAM 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 4:8"/>Shin ha"i unttunttu som"ii shaalaappe aad'd'iide kares's'eedda; Asay ogiyaan be'iide unttuntta erenna. Unttunttu galbbaykka unttunttu mek'etsaanna oyk'k'ettiide, mitsaadan meleedda.<verse eid="LAM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 4:9"/>Miyaabaa d'ayiide, loddu giide, koshan hayk'k'eeddawanttuppe olan hayk'k'eeddawanttu keeka. <verse eid="LAM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 4:10"/>Ta asaa bollan yeedda bayetsaa gaasuwaan, k'arettiyaa aayetuu barenttu yeleedda naanatuwaa doyissiide, barenttoo k'uma kessiide meeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:57">Zar. 28:57</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 5:10">Hiz. 5:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LAM 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 4:11"/>Med'inaa Godaa hank'k'uwaa s'uu'ay kumeedda; I bare suulliyaa hank'k'uwaa tigeedda. Yerusaalame katamaa baasuwaana meedda tamaa eetsi kesseedda.<verse eid="LAM 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 4:12"/>Ha sa'aan de'iyaa kaatetuwaappe woy kawutetsatuwaa giddon de'iyaa asaappe ooninne morkkii Yerusaalame penggiyaanna gelana giide ammanibeenna. <verse eid="LAM 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 4:13"/>Shin hawe haneeddawe Aa nabetuunne Aa k'eesatuu ootseedda nagaraa diraassa; k'ay unttunttu s'illotuwaa suutsaa Aa giddon gusseedda diraassa. <verse eid="LAM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 4:14"/>Unttunttu k'ook'e asaadan, ogiyaan tattaafiino; k'ay unttunttu suutsan tuneedda diraw, unttunttu mayuwaa ooninne bochchanaw koyenna. <verse eid="LAM 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 4:15"/>Hewaa diraw, Asay unttuntta, «Kichchite! Hintte tuna! Kichchite! Nuuna bochchoppite!» yaagiide unttunttu bolla waasseedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LAM 4:15">Yaatina, unttunttu bak'atiide toyilakatteedda wode, kawutetsatuwaa giddon de'iyaa Asay unttuntta, «Hintte nuunanna hawaan de'anaw danddaykkita» yaageeddino. <verse eid="LAM 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 4:16"/>Med'inaa Goday bare huup'iyaan unttuntta laaleedda; I unttunttoo laa"entso k'oppenna. Unttunttu k'eesatuu kka bonchchettibeykkino; unttunttu c'imatuukka nashettibeykkino.<verse eid="LAM 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 4:17"/>Nu ayifii maaduwaa demmanaw s'eelliidde, c'oo mela daabureedda. Nuuna ashshanaw danddayenna kawutetsatuwaa, unttunttu yaana giide wochcheeddo.<verse eid="LAM 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 4:18"/>Asatuu nu k'atamaa kaalliyaa diraw, nu katamaa ogiyaan hemettanaw danddayibeykko. Nu wurssetsay matatteedda; nu laytsay wureedda; nu d'ayiyaa wodiikka gakkeedda. <verse eid="LAM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 4:19"/>Nuuna yederssiyaawanttu saluwaana paalliyaa arggantsaappekka aad'd'iide elleelliino. Unttunttu nuuna deriyaa huup'iyaana yedersseeddino; k'ay bazzuwaan zuggiide, nuuna naageeddino.<verse eid="LAM 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 4:20"/>Med'inaa Goday okkeedda kaatiyaa, nuuni siid'iyaanna shemppiyaa nu shemppuwaa, unttunttu barenttu p'iriyaan oyk'k'eeddino. Nuuni Aa kuwaa garssan uttiide, kawutetsatuwaa giddon de'ana giide k'oppeeddo.<verse eid="LAM 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 4:21"/>Hinttenoo, Uus'a biittan de'iyaa Eedooma asatoo, nashetitenne pooc'u giite. Shin hank'k'uwaa s'uu'ay hinttekkokka gakkanawaa; hinttekka matsottiide, kallo attana.<verse eid="LAM 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 4:22"/>Hinttenoo, S'iyoone asatoo, hintte bayzzuwaa muruu poletteedda. Hawaappe sintsan I hinttena omooduwaan wotsenna.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LAM 4:22">Shin Eedooma asatoo, hintte bayzzuwaa I murana; hintte nagaraakka k'onc'c'issana.<verse eid="LAM 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LAM 5"/>
  <para style="s">Maarotaa Demanaw Woosaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LAM 5:1-22">5:1-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 5:1"/>Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, nu bolla gakkeeddawaa ubbaa hassaya; nuuna s'eella; nu kawushshaakka be'a! <verse eid="LAM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 5:2"/>Nu laata biittay allagatoo, nu golliikka betetoo imetteedda. <verse eid="LAM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 5:3"/>Nuuni aawuu hayk'k'eedda naanatuwaa gideeddo; nu aayetuukka am"e mac'c'a asaa gideeddino. <verse eid="LAM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 5:4"/>Nu ushiyaa haatsaw miishshaa c'iggeeto; eetsiyaa mitsaakka shammi akkeetto. <verse eid="LAM 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 5:5"/>Nuuna yederssiyaawanttu nu ginddiyaa s'ap'uwaa gakkeeddino. Nuuni daabureeddo, shin shemppanaw danddayibeykko. <verse eid="LAM 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 5:6"/>Nuuni k'uma kallana giide, Gibs'e asatoonne Asoore asatoo kushiyaa immeeddo. <verse eid="LAM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 5:7"/>Nagaraa ootseeddawanttu nu mayzza aawotuwaa; shin unttunttu ha"i de'ikkino. Unttunttu akkanaw bessiyaa muruwaa akkiyaawanttu nuuna.<verse eid="LAM 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 5:8"/>Ayiletuu nuuna mooddiyaawantta gideeddino; unttunttu kushiyaappekka nuuna wotsi akkiyaawe ittuunne baawa. <verse eid="LAM 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 5:9"/>Mashshaan wod'iyaawanttu bazzuwaan de'iyaa diraw, nuuni nu shemppuwaa sheneko giide, nu k'umaa demmeeddo. <verse eid="LAM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 5:10"/>Koshay suulleedda gaasuwaan harggina, nu galbbay tamaa c'ooc'iyaadan michchee. <verse eid="LAM 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 5:11"/>S'iyoonen mac'c'a asatuwaa, Yihudaa katamatuwaankka wodorotuwaa wolk'k'an oyk'k'iide bayzzeeddino. <verse eid="LAM 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 5:12"/>Kaappatuwaa afiide kak'k'eeddino; c'imatuukka bonchchettibeykkino. <verse eid="LAM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 5:13"/>Yalaga attuma asatuu wos'aan gaac'c'eeddino; attuma naanatuukka dees'o mitsaa tookkiide ganddigaareeddino. <verse eid="LAM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 5:14"/>C'ima asatuu katamaa penggen pirddanaw uttiyaawaa aggeeddino; yalaga attuma asatuu yetsaa yes's'iyaawaa aggeeddino. <verse eid="LAM 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 5:15"/>Nu wozanaappe nashechchay bi kichcheedda; nu durussaykka yeekoo laametteedda; <verse eid="LAM 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 5:16"/>kallachchay nu huup'iyaappe kunddi kichcheedda. Nuuni nagaraa ootseedda diraw, nuw aayye ana! <verse eid="LAM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 5:17"/>Hewaa diraw, nu wozanay daabureedda; nu ayifiikka galjjeedda. <verse eid="LAM 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 5:18"/>Ayaw gooppe, S'iyoone Derii mela gideedda; worakanatuukka an simeretiino.<verse eid="LAM 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 5:19"/>Shin abeet Med'inaa Godaw, neeni med'inaw kawutaasa; ne kawutetsaa araataykka yeletaa ubbaa gakkanaw de'ee. <verse eid="LAM 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 5:20"/>Neeni nuuna ayaw ubbaa wode dogay? K'ay hawaa keeshshaa adussa wodiyaa nuuna ayaw aggay? <verse eid="LAM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 5:21"/>Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, nuuna neekko zaara; nuunikka simmana! Nu wodiyaakka beniwaadan zaaraadde ooratsa! <verse eid="LAM 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 5:22"/>Neeni nuuna ubbaa mule aggaadiiyye? Ne hank'k'ookka zaway baaweeyye?<verse eid="LAM 5:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 5"/>
</usx>
